WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.239
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.239 --> 00:00:10.630
Today I am going to explain a science-fiction
drama film called “LX 2048.”

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.990
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:18.410
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:23.590
The movie begins with a scene from the near
future where a natural calamity known as the

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:27.230
'heat up' has caused people to stay indoors.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.400
This phenomenon was caused by the continuous
blazing heat of the sun.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.609
Because of the inhumane conditions, people
are utilizing a replica of themselves to operate

00:00:36.609 --> 00:00:37.690
outdoors.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:42.359
While the replica is sent to do the work outside,
people have become dormant as they have nothing

00:00:42.359 --> 00:00:44.190
to do inside their houses.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.100
Hence, they have acquired mental diseases.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.719
Lithium X is the only medicine that can help
them be normal as it can help people stay

00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:57.070
in shape by providing Vitamin D.
Next, we are introduced to Adam Bird, the

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.140
lead character of the movie.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:03.670
He is one of the few living humans to wake
up early and to go to work.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:08.021
One day after visiting a doctor, he gets to
know that he is going to die soon.

00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:13.590
A devastated Adam inquires with the doctor
as to whether he has any other options for

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.590
survival.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:19.050
The doctor responds that he can only survive
if someone donates his heart.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:23.620
The doctor also considers him fortunate after
learning that he has an insurance plan from

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:29.250
"Premium 3" that will cover his children's
education and upbringing after his death.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:34.280
Adam inquires whether he may utilize the Premium
3 insurance to get a healthy heart clone,

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:38.990
but the doctor responds that it is only feasible
if his wife agrees to the terms.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:44.570
When Adam hears this, he expresses his dissatisfaction
with his present relationship with his wife,

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.860
which is on the verge of divorce.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:51.890
Adam also finds out that the doctor he is
talking to is a clone itself which is unharmed

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.550
by the rays of the sun.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:59.000
He further despises how much the present society
seems to be submerged in technology.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.530
After analyzing Adam's vulnerable mental state,
the doctor arranges for him to see a psychiatrist.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:10.099
In the following scene, Adam is shown wearing
a VR headset and talking to his wife Reena.

00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:14.459
He curses his wife during their talk since
she doesn't seem to mind and care for the

00:02:14.459 --> 00:02:19.090
fact that he is dying and she also refuses
to see him face to face.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:23.750
Adam pities himself for loving his wife in
the first place and hangs up the phone.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:28.870
Afterwards, Adam dresses up in a hazmat suit
and drives his car in the scorching sun to

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.470
his vacant workplace.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:34.900
Here, we can see that the rest of his coworkers
have chosen to work from home.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:40.170
It seems like he works for a tech firm that
specializes in VR manufacture and production.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:44.409
He is alone in the entire office, sitting
around the conference table, arguing with

00:02:44.409 --> 00:02:46.239
his coworkers virtually.

00:02:46.239 --> 00:02:50.909
He advises his boss to avoid investing in
virtual reality headsets and instead focus

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:56.519
on the creation and research of a technology
dubbed CHIP, which he says will soon replace

00:02:56.519 --> 00:02:57.519
VR.

00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:02.370
Later, Adam exits his office and goes to the
psychiatrist for his planned appointment.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:07.680
At the psychiatrist’s office, Adam describes
his feeling of being a lone human strolling

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.920
outside in the sweltering heat.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.359
However, the present doctor also appears to
be a clone.

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:18.109
When Adam notices this, he exclaims that although
the clones have all the skills as the original

00:03:18.109 --> 00:03:21.459
ones, they lack a feeling of compassion and
emotions.

00:03:21.459 --> 00:03:24.780
The movie then cuts to an incident that occurred
months ago.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:29.360
Adam reaches home after work and finds his
children playing games and enjoying the virtual

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.360
world.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:34.470
He then sees his wife relaxing in the virtual
sunbath in her room.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:39.829
After a long day at work, he engages himself
in virtual sexual intercourse with a doll

00:03:39.829 --> 00:03:42.930
which gives simulations like real intercourse.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.769
During the climax of the scene, his wife Reena
appears in the room.

00:03:46.769 --> 00:03:49.319
Adam apologizes to her for not locking the
door.

00:03:49.319 --> 00:03:54.109
However, an angry Reena accuses him of cheating
on her with his online girlfriend.

00:03:54.109 --> 00:03:59.389
Adam tries to explain the awkward situation
to her but she ignores him and walks out.

00:03:59.389 --> 00:04:07.069
This was the incident that ignited their hostile
relationship.

00:04:07.069 --> 00:04:11.629
Back in the present, Adam wakes up and grooms
himself for the meeting that he has planned

00:04:11.629 --> 00:04:12.840
with his family.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.840
When he reaches home, Reena refuses to meet
him.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:20.079
Frustrated, he calls Reena virtually from
the main entrance and threatens to break through

00:04:20.079 --> 00:04:21.079
the door.

00:04:21.079 --> 00:04:26.740
Finally, Reena accepts to meet him outside
but shows no sadness or sympathy for the fact

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.120
that he is dying.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.430
Adam tries to explain to her that he should
be alive to make the family live happily in

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.560
the future and to overcome their expenses.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.349
But Reena adamantly answers that she will
cover all the expenses including his clone

00:04:40.349 --> 00:04:42.449
with the help of Premium 3.

00:04:42.449 --> 00:04:46.280
Adam tells her that his company is near to
bankruptcy and the family will not get any

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.949
insurance benefit if he dies at the moment.

00:04:48.949 --> 00:04:54.150
Despite Adam’s explanation, Reena refuses
to use Premium 3 for the clone of his heart

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:59.750
and suggests he use Lithium X so that he would
get enough time to save his bankrupt company.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.190
She literally does not care if he dies or
lives.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:08.349
The next day, Adam is seen calling the retirement
home to speak with a man named Donald Stein

00:05:08.349 --> 00:05:10.340
but gets no answer.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:14.889
After that, he gets stressed and calls his
AI girlfriend named Maria.

00:05:14.889 --> 00:05:18.990
Maria seems to be concerned that he is crying
and tries to comfort him.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:23.340
Despite the fact that Adam knows Maria has
been programmed to make him feel good, he

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.490
still believes that she loves her.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:29.639
He lies on his bed, listening to the dream
of Maria being with him.

00:05:29.639 --> 00:05:33.789
Suddenly he wakes up to Donald pointing a
gun at him.

00:05:33.789 --> 00:05:37.889
Donald asks Adam how he knows about him and
about the Chip technology.

00:05:37.889 --> 00:05:42.340
Adam explains that he tried to call him earlier
as he believes that he is the creator of the

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:43.610
Chip technology.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:48.180
Adam then asks for Donald’s help to save
his company along with his family.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:52.960
Adam then goes into a flashback and remembers
a clerk named Dennis Ryan, congratulating

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.419
him and Reena for having three kids.

00:05:55.419 --> 00:06:00.879
3 kids at that time was very rare as the population
was declining and people were barely getting

00:06:00.879 --> 00:06:03.009
married and having intercourse.

00:06:03.009 --> 00:06:07.009
The clerk then proposes to them an insurance
policy called “Premium 3”, which would

00:06:07.009 --> 00:06:09.860
help them to clone their lost family members.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:14.849
The clerk also reveals that it is developed
by the chief genetic engineer Donald Stein.

00:06:14.849 --> 00:06:18.830
Reena seems excited about the proposal but
Adam looks skeptical.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.949
Back in the present, Adam tells Donald that
he found him with the help of his dental records

00:06:22.949 --> 00:06:26.919
and also praises him for being the father
of human cloning.

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:32.000
Donald laughs at his words but nods in agreement
telling him that the augmented pigmentation

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.689
of the brain is not possible without using
the CHIP.

00:06:35.689 --> 00:06:40.180
After a few drinks, Donald opens up and says
that after the big heat up, he was assigned

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:44.230
by the state to clone humans who were not
affected by the sun.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.660
Adam expresses his hate toward the idea of
cloning humans and wants to get accepted for

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.250
who he is.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:54.729
Donald then mentions that he also found his
true love in his virtual girlfriend.

00:06:54.729 --> 00:06:58.699
The movie again cuts to the scene where Adam
and Reena are fighting after she found Adam

00:06:58.699 --> 00:07:00.479
having a virtual girlfriend.

00:07:00.479 --> 00:07:05.280
Reena is disgusted by the fact that a virtual
girl is able to satisfy him better than she

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.280
could.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.229
After their argument, Reena suggests that
their relationship would only work if Adam

00:07:10.229 --> 00:07:12.479
deletes his virtual girlfriend.

00:07:12.479 --> 00:07:15.400
Adam refuses, and their relationship ends.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:20.699
In the present, both Donald and Adam are now
connected to each other at another level after

00:07:20.699 --> 00:07:23.139
a night of drinking and smoking together.

00:07:23.139 --> 00:07:25.719
Donald claims that he can build a clone heart
for Adam.

00:07:25.719 --> 00:07:30.669
He also adds that the pain Adam is feeling
is emotional rather than physiological and

00:07:30.669 --> 00:07:33.099
concludes that his heart is normal.

00:07:33.099 --> 00:07:37.580
Adam is feeling pain for the reason of not
taking Lithium X. Donald accepts the fact

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:41.820
that he too created the clone of his virtual
girlfriend for satisfaction.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:46.419
He then purchased his freedom by selling the
patents of the technology of creating the

00:07:46.419 --> 00:07:47.419
chip.

00:07:47.419 --> 00:07:51.539
For the sake of the bond they have formed,
Donald promises to help Adam by creating a

00:07:51.539 --> 00:07:54.490
clone of his virtual girlfriend Maria.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:59.479
The next morning, Adam calls his mother and
feels weird about her avatar which she created

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:01.469
to be significantly younger.

00:08:01.469 --> 00:08:04.580
His mother asks him if he takes Lithium X
regularly.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:08.080
On hearing this, Adam expresses his hatred
towards the drug.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:12.889
He then notices his hand being burnt by the
sun and immediately covers the windows.

00:08:12.889 --> 00:08:17.449
Late at night, Reena pays him a visit and
inquires about his well-being.

00:08:17.449 --> 00:08:23.060
She is there with a plan to gain access to
Premium 3's privileges without Adam's death.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:28.270
She explains to him the idea of virtual assassination,
and also mentions that someone she knows will

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.300
create the paperwork required for the state
to approve his death.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:35.950
Adam is shocked to hear it and asks Reena
what is going to happen to him.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:40.800
Reena suggests him to do whatever he feels
like and also expresses that she has no problem

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.620
if he wants to be with Maria.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:47.420
At first, Adam refuses to accept her offer
but after knowing how much his wife hates

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.820
him, Adam reluctantly agrees to do it.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:54.420
Reena then informs him that she has already
done it and kisses him.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:59.630
Reena then hands him his new ID and his credentials
but Adam is worried about the fact that he

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:04.760
can no longer talk to his girlfriend Maria
as he is not Adam Bird anymore.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.450
His new name is found to be Richard Burbage.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:11.730
Reena apologizes for changing his identity
and also assures him that she will urge the

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.510
cloned Adam not to delete Maria.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:23.510
When Reena is about to return back, a van
hits her, killing her instantly.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:27.010
After some time, Police and paramedics arrive
at the scene.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:31.690
One of the officers reaches out to Adam and
expresses his condolences and also suggests

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.970
he see a therapist.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:37.320
He goes through Adams’s profile and finds
out that they are on a Premium 3 insurance

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.320
plan.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:42.200
He assures him that a better version of Reena
will arrive within some days and will take

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.930
care of the children.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:48.500
Following the officer's departure, Adam returns
to his room and attempts to get into his account,

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.620
only to discover that all of his credentials
have been changed.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:56.610
A nervous Adam then makes himself puke to
get rid of the booze in his system.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.400
After a while, he notices that someone is
at the door.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:04.310
When he reaches out, he discovers Maria, who
starts kissing him passionately.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:08.810
Adam is taken aback and can't take his gaze
away from Maria, as she is the girl of his

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:09.810
fantasies.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.920
He wants to be intimate with her, but Maria
mentions that she is still undergoing Donald's

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:14.990
tests.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:19.839
After some time, Adam discovers that Donald
had made love to Maria before transferring

00:10:19.839 --> 00:10:23.269
her to his house.

00:10:23.269 --> 00:10:26.649
Adam overreacts and Maria advises him to calm
down.

00:10:26.649 --> 00:10:30.510
She also tells him that she has the right
to look into other possibilities.

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.139
Later, Adam notices Maria showering.

00:10:33.139 --> 00:10:37.230
He then walks out into the living room and
begins searching Maria's handbag.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:41.139
Inside, he discovers protection and a transparent
chip.

00:10:41.139 --> 00:10:44.850
After Maria is done showering, Adam confronts
her about the chip.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:49.910
She responds that the chip can download and
transmit the complete brain of a dying person

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.790
to the virtual world.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:56.430
Adam is taken aback when he learns that a
single chip may hold a whole person.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:00.220
Adam stares at Maria, both impressed and terrified.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:03.640
As she intends to leave, Adam begs her to
stay with him.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:08.750
However, Maria rejects, claiming that her
body's cells are organized to fall in love

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.089
but not with him.

00:11:11.089 --> 00:11:15.740
Following Maria's departure, a giddy Adam
dances with the pleasure doll that Maria once

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.740
was.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:21.279
He then looks at the doll with enraged eyes
and begins stabbing it with a knife multiple

00:11:21.279 --> 00:11:22.279
times.

00:11:22.279 --> 00:11:26.199
In the next scene, Adam is seen lying in a
corner, with his body trembling.

00:11:26.199 --> 00:11:31.380
A ring at the door awakens him up from his
gloomy state and he crawls to the door, only

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:35.019
to be greeted by Reena's idealized version
of himself.

00:11:35.019 --> 00:11:39.830
The cloned Adam talks about their wife’s
death with a cooler attitude and appearance.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:44.690
He then begins to judge the real Adam based
on his appearance and the state of his house.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:48.660
He also tells him that he would not harm him
because he was created to only use violence

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.170
in self-defense.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:54.389
Clone Adam praises Reena and says that she
is a great woman but the real Adam can't see

00:11:54.389 --> 00:11:56.279
it because of his ignorance.

00:11:56.279 --> 00:12:00.390
All this while, the real Adam is shocked to
see the clone’s appearance.

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:05.130
He then asks clone Adam to strip in front
of him to check his body structure.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:09.310
After witnessing all of this, the real Adam
begins ranting and blaming Donald for his

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.330
current state.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:14.350
He also inquires about clone Adam's opinions
on assassinating Donald.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:18.709
Real Adam is irritated by the fact that the
cloned Adam is better at everything than him.

00:12:18.709 --> 00:12:23.180
The clone expresses sympathy for the real
Adam and requests that he embrace his new

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.180
life.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:27.430
This annoys the real Adam and he carries a
gun with him.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:31.550
Clone Adam then follows real Adam to the room
he enters, saying that he should be able to

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.990
accept the changes happening in society.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:38.700
He also predicts that in the not-too-distant
future, everyone will migrate to the digital

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:39.709
realm.

00:12:39.709 --> 00:12:44.510
Real Adam then recalls the fact that he can't
be alive in a world where another Adam exists,

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.290
so he points the gun at the clone.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:51.990
In an attempt to save himself, the clone reminds
Adam why Reena replaced him.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.519
He then remembers that he is dying.

00:12:54.519 --> 00:13:00.120
Clone Adam then suggests real Adam take the
Lithium X pill in order to call him down.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:04.861
As he is about to do so, he recovers from
the manipulation and aims the gun at clone

00:13:04.861 --> 00:13:05.861
Adam.

00:13:05.861 --> 00:13:10.529
The defense mechanism of the clone kicks in
and the gun slips off real Adams’s hand

00:13:10.529 --> 00:13:15.880
and drops to the table, making the gun fire
right through the forehead of real Adam.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.829
In the next scene, cloned Adam is burying
the real Adam.

00:13:19.829 --> 00:13:24.120
After returning home, he takes some time to
pick from the two sets of clothes.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:28.540
Finally, the clone of Reena also appears at
the door and the two of them connect with

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.670
each other in no time.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:34.940
Inside the house, the two of them share an
intimate moment and also plan to replace their

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:38.960
kids with smarter ones with the help of Premium
3.

